{
  "id": "6a9e736acdb816cd585aae90",
  "title": "着席指定席",
  "created": 1788769176,
  "updated": 1788769905,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a9e736acdb816cd585aae90",
      "text": "着席指定席",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788769176,
      "updated": 1788769452
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9e74ab00000000002b840c",
      "text": "メリット",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788769452,
      "updated": 1788769452
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9e74ab00000000002b840d",
      "text": "\t前の人が立たないため、座ったままでも確実に[ステージ]が見える",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788769452,
      "updated": 1788769452
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9e74ab00000000002b840e",
      "text": "\t長時間の公演でも足腰が疲れず、体力を温存できる",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788769452,
      "updated": 1788769452
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9e74ab00000000002b840f",
      "text": "デメリット",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788769452,
      "updated": 1788769452
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9e74ab00000000002b8410",
      "text": "\t盛り上がる曲でも周りに合わせて立ち上がることができない",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788769452,
      "updated": 1788769452
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9e74ab00000000002b8411",
      "text": "\tステージから距離があるため、肉眼でステージを物理的に確認しづらい",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788769452,
      "updated": 1788769452
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9e74ab00000000002b8412",
      "text": "\t\t設置モニターで確認するか、[双眼鏡]を使うかの2択",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788769452,
      "updated": 1788769531
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9e75e800000000002b8420",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788769768,
      "updated": 1788769768
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9e751d00000000002b841a",
      "text": "全席着席指定席のライブ、イベントがあったりする",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788769566,
      "updated": 1788769768
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9e756200000000002b841c",
      "text": "\t[Vtuber]の個人[リアルイベント]や[トークイベント]・[トークショー]等",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788769634,
      "updated": 1788769905
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9e75cc00000000002b841f",
      "text": "\t[オケコン]はイベントによる",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788769741,
      "updated": 1788769765
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9e74c900000000002b8419",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788769482,
      "updated": 1788769482
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9e74ab00000000002b8414",
      "text": "[コンサート・ライブ]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788769452,
      "updated": 1788769452
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9e739800000000002b8409",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788769176,
      "updated": 1788769179
    }
  ]
}